Created Mar 10, 2022, 01:33PM::md.update
Summary::md.summary
  I want a feature that is submaps on top of the main map. It will be a bit difficult,
  but it should have the following features:

  1. ✓ Ability to move the submap as an entire whole.
  2. ✓ Ability to minimize/maximize the submap
  3. (moved) Submap has a different grid type than the parent map.
  4. <s>Submap has a different scale than the parent map.</s>
  5. ✓ Selection starting inside the submap only selects objects in the submap.
  6. ✓ Selection starting outside the submap only selects the submap itself, not the interior objects.
  7. ✓ Deleting the submap deletes the inner objects.
  8. ✓ Drawing starting inside the submap draws inside the submap.
  9. ✓ Drawing starting outside the submap draws outside the submap.
  9. ✓ Submap is not pannable.
  10. ✓ Submap is resizable.
  11. ✓ Undo/redo is shared with parent map.
Updated Mar 10, 2022, 08:23PM::md.update
  More features:

  1. ✓ Draw the sub map’s grid, not necessarily aligned with parent’s grid.
  2. ✓ Snap/scale, etc. to sub map’s grid.
  3. ✓ Measure tool works according to the subgrid.
  4. (moved) Prevent moving outside of submap.
  4. (moved) Prevent drawing outside of submap.
  5. ✓ Paste into the submap.
Updated Mar 10, 2022, 11:36PM::md.update
  1. ✓ Objects contained by the map need to have their coordinates be relative to the map.
Updated Mar 11, 2022, 03:20PM::md.update
  1. ✓ Better minimize ui (button instead of in the edit menu)
  2. (moved) Shrinks to the size of a square/hex
  3. (moved) Remembers the origin square/hex is maybe?
Updated Mar 13, 2022, 01:40AM::md.update
  This is enough features to ship it.
Updated Mar 14, 2022, 02:32AM::md.update
  Resizable
Updated Mar 14, 2022, 03:03AM::md.update
